{{main|2026 Jingshan Tennis Open}}

[[Lulu Sun]] was the reigning champion,<ref>{{cite web|url=https://tennisuptodate.com/wta/sun-shines-bright-in-china-lulu-sun-comes-out-victorious-in-the-jingsham-open|title=Sun shines bright in China: Lulu Sun comes out victorious in the Jingshan Open|publisher=tennisuptodate.com|accessdate=28 September 2025}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.wtatennis.com/news/4371118/sun-rises-again-to-win-first-wta-125-title-in-jingshan|title=Sun rises again to win first WTA 125 title in Jingshan|publisher=Women's Tennis Association|accessdate=28 September 2025}}</ref> but did not participate this year.

